    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be monslihte.] [Ld] Gif hwa Cristenes mannes blód ageote, ne cume he na on ðæs cyninges neawiste, ær he on dædbote ga, swa him biscop tæce ⁊ his scrift him wisige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone sheds the blood of a Christian man, he shall not come anywhere near the king, until he proceeds to do penance, as the bishop appoints for him or his confessor directs him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa Cristenes mannes blod ageote, ne cume he na on ðæs cyninges ánsyne, ær he on dædbote ga, swa biscop him tæce ⁊ his scrift him wissige.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
